Namespace -- option specifying the namespace for MRDI serialization
*******************************************************************

Description
===========

A symbol used as an option to *note addSaveMethod: addSaveMethod,, *note
addLoadMethod: addLoadMethod,, and *note saveMRDI: saveMRDI, to specify which
namespace to use.

Different namespaces allow the same MRDI file format to represent objects from
different computer algebra systems. The "Macaulay2" and "Oscar" namespaces are
built in.  Custom namespaces can be registered with *note addNamespace:
addNamespace,.

When passed to *note saveMRDI: saveMRDI,, this determines which set of save
methods is used and what appears in the _ns field of the JSON output.

When passed to *note addSaveMethod: addSaveMethod, or *note addLoadMethod:
addLoadMethod,, this determines which namespace the method is registered under.

The same object can be serialized under different namespaces.

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : saveMRDI 5                                                           |
|                                                                          |
|o1 = {"_ns": {"Macaulay2": ["https://macaulay2.com", "1.26.05"]}, "_type":|
|     "ZZ", "data": "5"}                                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : saveMRDI(5, Namespace => "Oscar")                                    |
|                                                                          |
|o2 = {"_ns": {"Oscar": ["https://github.com/oscar-system/Oscar.jl",       |
|     "1.6.0"]}, "_type": {"params": {"_type": "ZZRing"}, "name":          |
|     "ZZRingElem"}, "data": "5"}                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* Menu:

* addNamespace::                register a namespace for MRDI serialization

Functions with optional argument named Namespace:
=================================================

  * "addLoadMethod(...,Namespace=>...)" -- see *note addLoadMethod:
    addLoadMethod, -- register a method for deserializing a type from MRDI
    format
  * "addSaveMethod(...,Namespace=>...)" -- see *note addSaveMethod:
    addSaveMethod, -- register a method for serializing a type to MRDI format
  * "saveMRDI(...,Namespace=>...)" -- see *note saveMRDI: saveMRDI, --
    serialize a Macaulay2 object to MRDI JSON format

For the programmer
==================

The object *note Namespace: Namespace, is a *note symbol:
(Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

